"""Generate eight new public source templates; no staging or execution authority.

The caller supplies the independently accepted recipe digest and explicit offline
files. Every input is re-read before rendering; no path, clock or environment
enters the generated bytes. A result is an unqualified source proposal, not a
bank, ISO, context seal, built image or authority. The finite plan names the
additional maintained installer/helpers and the still-required lifecycle tar.
"""
from __future__ import annotations

